MID_MV20_04: <SH>
MID_MV20_04_m001: (scared/shocked exert)
MID_MV20_04_m002: (choking/coughing sounds)
MID_MV20_04_m003: (exert as he notices)
MID_MV20_04_m004: Oh, Father. All your hard work has paid off.
MID_MV20_04_m005: Your long-awaited homecoming.
MID_MV20_04_m006: Take her down!
MID_MV20_04_m007: (charging shout)
MID_MV20_04_m008: Come. Celebrate...
MID_MV20_04_m009: the second birth of this world's rightful ruler.
MID_MV20_04_m010: (baby crying)
MID_MV20_04_m011: (terrified shout)
MID_MV20_04_m012: (screaming)
MID_MV20_04_m013: Rejoice with me...
MID_MV20_04_m014: at the advent of the underworld.
MID_MV20_04_m015: (baby crying)
MID_MV20_04_m016: (groaning sounds)
MID_MV20_04_m017: Let us go, my dear father.
MID_MV20_04_m018: (attack exerts)
MID_MV20_04_m019: (death exerts)